│╭─────────────────────────────────Layout Lab─────────────────────────────────╮│
││Constraint Types:                                                           ││
││                                                                            ││
││  Fixed(10)    — exactly 10 rows/cols                                       ││
││  Min(5)       — at least 5, grows if space                                 ││
││  Max(20)      — at most 20, shrinks if needed                              ││
││  Percentage(50) — 50% of available space                                   ││
││  Fill(1)     — takes remaining space                                       ││
││                                                                            ││
││Layout direction: Vertical                                                  ││
││                                                                            ││
